_ohc=tKowYcT2JpUQ7kNvwFmVWo_&_nc_oc=AdqZXD4gAm2VHLByOwfIG-X23NNRWxSJbGylOMi-0kMbkvnVGayIBAKTo9ANDUhILtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-kFLHZko-6XOwjA8guTZ-lbJ54FTcaKTuId4YrJsLsxA&oe=6A4116EF"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57162.png", "id": "2087193361730451", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462203_2087193365063784_862658085619166334_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0CVzsmFhnW8Q7kNvwHU-_xi&_nc_oc=AdpdaXC_16GUetXVRvjaZt1_3cmvPXfonLKzvt2vGEe21Ch0k9KVXRDKxe5K4B53A2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-gNu0Y6vJlnRFOgr_bj4bAyGyNWKZSTKFA5qxNdQ_nLQ&oe=6A413327"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57163.png", "id": "565742826430110", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031337_565742829763443_2348743012161439434_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3oadPlMxEsYQ7kNvwEG-Taj&_nc_oc=AdroCJK_3uP5vZoNBbGjeCtPGKuZVURdKJHV0a-nbqTB2DtXQV-xuJd4H8ndVVOgWmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8VgX09cNTduz3IMT6xukiZcW_-7G4EaRurTOEy9RXLiQ&oe=6A411251"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57164.png", "id": "457325230760902", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485575_457325234094235_6559372112880837045_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8NNWvBtSGSAQ7kNvwFTboth&_nc_oc=Adplh1cF5xUjjHiFqAXz1eVhLrq25XQV987KsEh_bBNZSxiIYscv3oUKl29Jp9-OVAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Ym5N8OOtGn5SmGGiI2cUOpZaJiamBeIFMfCSbCP6JhA&oe=6A4134E7"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57165.png", "id": "2043351619496913", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031437_2043351622830246_8775906402630274259_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oilHvwazyRoQ7kNvwHTpzHS&_nc_oc=Adrkf8GwD8lhVShvssksIkkHvsCNjZJWMcUR-jPSIWXX7eI2SVz8gYD6AvKPe11ZMz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af99ZHc1su37bgSTe_ggza90FwbQFnmjjDs7SW9b7HP89w&oe=6A4123C7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ExitToilet", "keywords": ["escape", "puzzles", "inference"], "long_description": "Game Description\nThe CEO of a biotech company mysteriously vanishes one morning. As a determined journalist, you sneak into his mansion to investigate, only to find yourself trapped in a creepy bathroom. Each clue and puzzle brings you closer to uncovering the truth\u2014but the deeper you go, the darker the secrets become.\n\nThis escape room is a test of wit, courage, and observation. Solve puzzles, uncover a sinister conspiracy, and escape before time runs out.\n\nGame Features\nGripping Narrative: A story full of twists and hidden secrets.\nImmersive Environment: Tense atmosphere with detailed designs and sound.\nChallenging Puzzles: Solve intricate puzzles with keen observation.\nPsychological Tension: Every revelation brings more danger.\nComplete VR Experience: Intense first-person perspective.\n\nGameplay\nExplore and Observe: Examine the environment for clues.\nSolve Puzzles: Unlock barriers and piece together the mystery.\nUncover the Truth: Discover the secrets behind the CEO\u2019s disappearance.\nSurvive and Escape: Stay calm and find the way out.\n\nIdeal Players\nFans of mystery and puzzles.\nThrill-seekers looking for a chilling experience.\nThose who enjoy story-driven gameplay.\nReady to face your fears and uncover the truth? The challenge awaits!\n\nControls\nHold the A button to move.\nPress the grab button to interact with objects.", "short_description": "The CEO of a biotech giant vanishes mysteriously during his commute, shocking the world. As a journalist, you sneak into his mansion for answers but become trapped in a chilling bathroom full of secrets.\n\nThis isn\u2019t just an escape room\u2014it\u2019s a test of wit and courage. Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and reveal the dark truth behind the CEO\u2019s disappearance. Face your fears, escape, and expose a conspiracy that will shake the world.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "LOGO.png", "id": "2597103487166681", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86625129_2597103490500014_3922643013080904156_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KPH0Jk9kJxYQ7kNvwGYgDF7&_nc_oc=AdqxG8iQXEpS7GYtwGsmd-hfEzsvbpZLWeFT1txJ95ajphFLCtpy7U5hrOBL8ACld6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Ts_v-fZUYBMyIg6F7IbicsXPd56Z_LQMi8B6o6L4PBw&oe=6A4131C4"}, {"file_name": "1008x1440.png", "id": "1182949610072593", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75392232_1182949613405926_2898506178213785049_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eyFagaYHAhAQ7kNvwH3zy8T&_nc_oc=Adp72zEMHH-YzrUYoz4X80y0m9d93-wNUoC0p4uo-2rYsugQ-GF9cLAe0c8hsa2Ywuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8vtxQ3kajl7U4Rm5SVzEniQFXQxZpfsscArexmu7KT8g&oe=6A413FB6"}, {"file_name": "1080x360.png", "id": "1144873710614671", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031548_1144873713948004_7837426084537891215_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7I0-ovqGMU4Q7kNvwHdoksS&_nc_oc=AdrOLAYjd888qEAeOxJIW-MzpZsVKniAnBdgoNBD3kzJISMzeNPiZmi00WcsLRJj_-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84l4P2F-So8SjEoqVr-OLomMGFV-vSZp__A7f8lbVEcQ&oe=6A41430D"}, {"file_name": "LOGO.png", "id": "1133433471817081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375772_1133433475150414_1715205268410684577_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l1x2fqf3kYYQ7kNvwFU7u77&_nc_oc=AdopSvYcZ-Gf49IUX507HZRKPa0BqpB51ZDZEfANtRsCtYuEftFKFGQUY1-MdNnIv1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af91JzeuWNfHwuIawKkd6iMpwOZR-uWlbRebMhfTgg2qGQ&oe=6A4147C1"}, {"file_name": "3000x900.png", "id": "930390195865438", "image_type": "APP_I